//
// js_widget_runtime 0.4.156 renders a `voxel` node as the "Voxel world"
// placeholder (Icons.landscape) exactly when the renderer's `voxelWorld`
// is null (json_widget_renderer.dart `_voxel`). The runtime engine exposes
